title    Brimstone Run
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster placeholder)
about    Placeholder Inferno score that proves the score engine. Brass over choir stabs, a driving low ostinato, timpani and toms.
tempo    172
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.3

voice lead   brass    vol=0.8  pan=-0.1
voice choir  choir    vol=0.45 pan=0.25 center=A4 gate=0.6
voice bass   synbass  vol=0.8  oct=1
voice timp   timpani  vol=0.7
voice kick   kick     vol=0.9
voice snare  snare    vol=0.55
voice tom    tomlo    vol=0.6  pan=-0.2
voice crash  crash    vol=0.35 pan=0.2

pattern intro
timp  | D2!- . . . . . . | A1 A1 A1 A1 A1! A1! A1! A1! |
tom   | x... x... | x.x. xxXX |

pattern A
lead  | D5--- F5- E5 D5 | Eb5--- G5- F5 Eb5 | D5- A5- F5- D5- | E5- G5- C5--- |
choir | [Dm]!- . . [Dm]!- . . | [Eb]!- . . [Eb]!- . . | [Dm]!- . . [Dm]!- . . | [C]!- . . [C]!- . . |
bass  | D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 | Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 | D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 | C2 C2 C2 C2 C2 C2 C2 C2 |
timp  | D2!- . . . . . . | _ | _ | A1 A1 A1 A1 A1! A1! A1! A1! |
kick  | x.xx x.x. | % | % | % |
snare | ..x. ..x. | % | % | ..x. xxXX |
tom   | _ | _ | _ | .... xxXX |
crash | X... .... | _ | _ | _ |

# B keeps A's drums over a new progression
pattern B from A
lead  | F5- D5- Bb4- D5- | E5- C#5- A4--- | D5 E5 F5 G5 A5--- | C#6- A5- E5- C#5- |
choir | [Bb]!- . . [Bb]!- . . | [A]!- . . [A]!- . . | [Dm]!- . . [Dm]!- . . | [A]!- . . [A7]!- . . |
bass  | Bb1 Bb1 Bb1 Bb1 Bb1 Bb1 Bb1 Bb1 | A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 | D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 D2 | A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 A1 |
timp  | Bb1!- . . . . . . | A1!- . . . . . . | D2!- . . . . . . | A1 A1 A1 A1 A1! A1! A1! A1! |

play intro
loop A B
